OL,3,GNEWSAMystery hum has become
OL,4,A'soundtrack' to town's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a historic market town say
OL,7,Fa "persistent industrial noise" has
OL,8,Fbecome the "soundtrack" to their lives.
OL,10,FJames Beale, who said locals "could not
OL,11,Fescape" the sound, claimed the noise
OL,12,Fwas coming from the Ball Aerocan
OL,13,Fmanufacturing plant in Devizes,
OL,14,FWiltshire.
OL,16,FHowever the company said it had been
OL,17,Fcommitted to the town and "being a good
OL,18,Fneighbour" since the factory's
OL,19,Facquisition in 2011. Local town
OL,20,Fcouncillors also say they are not
OL,21,Fcertain the noise always comes from the
OL,22,Ffactory.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
