OL,3,GNEWSAMystery hum has become
OL,4,A'soundtrack' to town's life
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Council said it refused a
OL,7,Fpartly retrospective planning
OL,8,Fapplication for the plant's associated
OL,9,Fworks in June following the conclusion
OL,10,Fit produced an "unacceptable noise
OL,11,Fimpact" on nearby homes.
